{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"feather_bundle","model_identifier":"feather_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## feather_bundle\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (6 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.6..3.8, y -2.2..10.0, z -0.8..1.2 (size 7.4 x 12.2 x 2.0 u = 21 x 34 x 6 cm).\nFeather bundle: four long goose and hawk feathers (white, grey, brown) fanned slightly, quills tied with cord at the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 2.2.\n"},"description":"## feather_bundle\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (6 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.6..3.8, y -2.2..10.0, z -0.8..1.2 (size 7.4 x 12.2 x 2.0 u = 21 x 34 x 6 cm).\nFeather bundle: four long goose and hawk feathers (white, grey, brown) fanned slightly, quills tied with cord at the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 2.2.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"quill_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.9500000000000001,-2.0,-0.15],"to":[-0.65,1.0,0.15],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,-2,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,0,24.3,3.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[25,0,25.3,3.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26,0,26.3,3.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[27,0,27.3,3.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4,12,4.3,12.3],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[5,12,5.3,12.3],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3de12b73-c5f7-504c-aa47-681f519acbe2","rotation":[0,0,10]},{"name":"vane_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_m